#: ../../api/methods/delete_business_account_gift.rst:3
msgid "deleteBusinessAccountGift"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.methods.delete_business_account_gift.DeleteBusinessAccountGift:1 of
msgid ""
"Deletes a regular gift owned by a managed business account without "
"receiving Telegram Stars for it. Requires the "
"*can_convert_gifts_to_stars* business bot right. The gift can be deleted "
"only if it isn't limited (the field *total_count* of the "
":class:`litegram.types.gift.Gift` is omitted) and wasn't refunded. "
"Returns :code:`True` on success."
msgstr ""
"Удаляет обычный подарок управляемого бизнес-аккаунта без начисления звёзд"
" Telegram. Требуется право бизнес-бота *can_convert_gifts_to_stars*. "
"Удалить можно только подарок без ограничения тиража (поле *total_count* "
"объекта :class:`litegram.types.gift.Gift` отсутствует), за который не был"
" оформлен возврат. При успехе возвращает :code:`True`."

#: litegram.methods.delete_business_account_gift.DeleteBusinessAccountGift:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deletebusinessaccountgift"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#deletebusinessaccountgift"

#: litegram.methods.delete_business_account_gift.DeleteBusinessAccountGift.business_connection_id:1
#: of
msgid "Unique identifier of the business connection"
msgstr "Уникальный идентификатор бизнес-подключения"

#: litegram.methods.delete_business_account_gift.DeleteBusinessAccountGift.owned_gift_id:1
#: of
msgid "Unique identifier of the regular gift that should be deleted"
msgstr "Уникальный идентификатор обычного подарка, который нужно удалить"

